          "styles": {},
          "text": "Vooh - 可能是最接近原生App的PWA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_6f64199cb835a2ed1f4a148c_b633",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "Vooh---可能是最接近原生App的PWA",
        "level": 1
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_6f64199cb835a2ed1f4a148c_b634",
      "props": {
        "caption": "vooh-cover.png",
        "url": "asset:asset_12a66d66352907beb8be719b"
      },
      "type": "image"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "前情提要",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_6f64199cb835a2ed1f4a148c_b635",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "前情提要",
        "level": 1
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "苦于现在各大音乐流媒体平台群雄割据，一个播放列表的音乐被拆的七零八落，听个歌都得开好几家会员，索性直接不用任何流媒体平台，直接听本地的歌曲。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_6f64199cb835a2ed1f4a148c_b636",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "iOS上最好的听歌平台莫过于Apple Music了，但是取消订阅后只剩下了从电脑端iTunes导入歌曲的能力，每次想听点新歌都不方便，于是想到了做一个PWA，用来在手机上听下载的歌曲。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_6f64199cb835a2ed1f4a148c_b637",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "children": [],
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "用最新的Web技术去不知名小网站下载mp3听歌的操作，有种在21世纪茹毛饮血的感觉了。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "id": "post_6f64199cb835a2ed1f4a148c_b639",
          "props": {},
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_6f64199cb835a2ed1f4a148c_b638",
      "props": {},
      "type": "quote"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "听起来这件事情很简单，但实际上，一旦扯到移动端适配，坑可就太多了，我准备用一系列文章来记录下Vooh，史上最接近原生App的PWA应用的诞生。这其中与浏览器厂商斗智斗勇的心酸血泪史，实在是几天几夜都说不完。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_6f64199cb835a2ed1f4a148c_b640",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "如果想了解Vooh的各种技术详情，可以持续关注我的博客专栏",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "https://glink25.github.io/tag/Vooh/",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "href": "https://glink25.github.io/tag/Vooh/",
          "type": "link"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "，后续也会将Vooh相关的代码开源",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_6f64199cb835a2ed1f4a148c_b641",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_6f64199cb835a2ed1f4a148c_b642",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "如你所见，",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "Vooh",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "href": "https://vooh.pages.dev/",
          "type": "link"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 点击直达，感受21世纪新时代Web的魅力吧。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_6f64199cb835a2ed1f4a148c_b643",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "为了最佳的体验，请将Vooh作为PWA安装后使用，iOS用户需要使用Safari的分享按钮添加到主屏幕，Android用户需要下载Chrome浏览器才能安装到桌面。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_6f64199cb835a2ed1f4a148c_b644",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "对于安卓机型自带侧滑返回的机型，建议开启设置中的“路由兼容模式”，这是一个实验性功能，可以有效提升返回键的使用体验。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_6f64199cb835a2ed1f4a148c_b645",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "children": [],
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "当然如果是非 Chrome/iOS 最新版的话当我没说。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "id": "post_6f64199cb835a2ed1f4a148c_b647",
          "props": {},
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_6f64199cb835a2ed1f4a148c_b646",
      "props": {},
      "type": "quote"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "版权声明：",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_6f64199cb835a2ed1f4a148c_b648",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "版权声明",
        "level": 1
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "Vooh本身是做给个人使用的，并不提供音乐下载能力，里面的在线搜索功能实际上只有装饰的作用，为了游客可以更好地感受到Vooh的使用体验，无论怎么搜索结果都是固定的那几首测试用无版权歌曲。后续会增加文件夹读取功能和本地歌曲导入功能。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_6f64199cb835a2ed1f4a148c_b649",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ],
